<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1946051350"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1637996675"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="I Love U"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="The Chainsmokers"/><amll:meta key="album" value="So Far So Good"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:05.523"><div begin="00:00.000" end="02:51.583"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:04.693" itunes:key="L1">（いけいけ 団長、頑張れ 頑張れ 団長）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">出发吧 出发吧 长官 加油 加油 长官</span></p><p begin="00:05.349" end="00:08.869" itunes:key="L2">In the Range outside and I'm thinking about loose ends<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在路虎车外 我心里想着未知的结局</span></p><p begin="00:10.076" end="00:13.537" itunes:key="L3">Even though we cut ties I don't wanna be just friends<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我们斩断情丝 但我不愿与你维持朋友的关系</span></p><p begin="00:14.637" end="00:17.936" itunes:key="L4">From the day I got your number like Paris in the summer it ends<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从我拿到你电话号码那天起 就像盛夏时节的巴黎一样 一切戛然而止</span></p><p begin="00:19.218" end="00:22.428" itunes:key="L5">Every day that goes by I wish I was in your bed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄然逝去的每一天 我都希望我躺在你的床上</span></p><p begin="00:23.039" end="00:25.801" itunes:key="L6">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(噢-喔-噢) 我爱你 上帝啊</span></p><p begin="00:24.649" end="00:25.797" itunes:key="L7">I love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深爱着你</span></p><p begin="00:26.745" end="00:28.181" itunes:key="L8">Oh, God<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的天啊</span></p><p begin="00:27.714" end="00:29.589" itunes:key="L9">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竭尽全力 渴望找到我们无法长相厮守的原因</span></p><p begin="00:28.884" end="00:32.938" itunes:key="L10">Tryin' to find a reason why we can't work this out</p><p begin="00:32.320" end="00:33.918" itunes:key="L11">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(噢-噢-噢) 我已情难自拔 我的天哪</span></p><p begin="00:33.818" end="00:34.981" itunes:key="L12">I love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深爱着你</span></p><p begin="00:35.781" end="00:37.792" itunes:key="L13">Oh, my God<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的天啊</span></p><p begin="00:36.847" end="00:38.720" itunes:key="L14">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以找到我们无法长相厮守的原因</span></p><p begin="00:37.805" end="00:41.530" itunes:key="L15">It's hard to find a reason why we can't work this out</p><p begin="00:41.745" end="00:45.866" itunes:key="L16">Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我爱你 我爱你 耶)</span></p><p begin="00:46.353" end="00:50.677" itunes:key="L17">Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我早已沦陷 早已沦陷 噢)</span></p><p begin="00:50.999" end="00:53.862" itunes:key="L18">Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我爱你 噢-噢) 耶 耶 耶</span></p><p begin="00:53.872" end="00:55.812" itunes:key="L19">I love you</p><p begin="00:56.756" end="00:58.598" itunes:key="L4014">I love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深爱着你</span></p><p begin="00:58.783" end="01:00.290" itunes:key="L20">Oh, my God<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的天啊</span></p><p begin="01:00.827" end="01:04.052" itunes:key="L21">You were on the West side I was driving down the I-10<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你以前住在西边 我曾沿着10号州际公路前行 只为与你相见</span></p><p begin="01:05.467" end="01:08.640" itunes:key="L22">And the song came on got me thinking who you chose instead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">动人的歌声在耳畔响起 让我思索着你选择的对象</span></p><p begin="01:10.170" end="01:13.258" itunes:key="L23">Oh, I never thought twice but I wonder what you see in them<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先 我从未再三考虑 但我想知道你如何看待他们</span></p><p begin="01:14.568" end="01:17.805" itunes:key="L24">Another day goes by that I can't get you out of my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天我都对你魂牵梦萦</span></p><p begin="01:18.501" end="01:20.213" itunes:key="L25">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(噢-喔-噢) 我爱你 上帝啊</span></p><p begin="01:19.882" end="01:21.160" itunes:key="L26">I love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深爱着你</span></p><p begin="01:21.961" end="01:23.161" itunes:key="L27">Oh, God<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的天啊</span></p><p begin="01:23.171" end="01:24.313" itunes:key="L28">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竭尽全力 渴望找到我们无法长相厮守的原因</span></p><p begin="01:24.323" end="01:27.674" itunes:key="L29">Tryin' to find a reason why we can't work this out</p><p begin="01:27.684" end="01:28.905" itunes:key="L30">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(噢-噢-噢) 我已情难自拔 我的天哪</span></p><p begin="01:29.210" end="01:30.671" itunes:key="L31">I love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深爱着你</span></p><p begin="01:31.120" end="01:32.618" itunes:key="L32">Oh, my God<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的天啊</span></p><p begin="01:32.218" end="01:33.615" itunes:key="L33">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以找到我们无法长相厮守的原因</span></p><p begin="01:33.471" end="01:36.965" itunes:key="L34">It's hard to find a reason why we can't work this out</p><p begin="01:37.204" end="01:41.454" itunes:key="L35">Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我爱你 我爱你 耶)</span></p><p begin="01:41.864" end="01:46.414" itunes:key="L36">Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我早已沦陷 早已沦陷 噢)</span></p><p begin="01:46.591" end="01:50.933" itunes:key="L37">Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我爱你 噢-噢) 耶 耶 耶</span></p><p begin="01:49.182" end="01:51.227" itunes:key="L13046">(I love you)</p><p begin="01:52.160" end="01:54.312" itunes:key="L13267">(I love you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(我爱你)</span></p><p begin="01:54.782" end="01:59.427" itunes:key="L38">When it hits, I'm convinced that you know it's not over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使这份感情画上句点 但我相信你知道一切尚未结束</span></p><p begin="01:59.437" end="02:04.015" itunes:key="L39">All my love's counterfeit unless you're comin' over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的爱将会消逝 除非你决定见我一面</span></p><p begin="02:04.025" end="02:08.943" itunes:key="L40">Do you think of my voice when your city gets colder?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你定居的城市变得愈发寒冷时 你是否会想起我的声音</span></p><p begin="02:09.253" end="02:14.118" itunes:key="L41">（いけいけ 団長、頑張れ 頑張れ 団長）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">出发吧 出发吧 长官 加油 加油 长官</span></p><p begin="02:14.128" end="02:15.328" itunes:key="L42">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深爱着你</span></p><p begin="02:15.338" end="02:16.752" itunes:key="L43">I love you</p><p begin="02:17.509" end="02:19.167" itunes:key="L44">Oh, God<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的天啊</span></p><p begin="02:18.490" end="02:20.128" itunes:key="L45">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竭尽全力 渴望找到我们无法长相厮守的原因</span></p><p begin="02:19.641" end="02:23.498" itunes:key="L46">Tryin' to find a reason why we can't work this out</p><p begin="02:23.097" end="02:24.591" itunes:key="L47">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(噢-噢-噢) 我已情难自拔 我的天哪</span></p><p begin="02:24.601" end="02:26.218" itunes:key="L48">I love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深爱着你</span></p><p begin="02:26.581" end="02:28.287" itunes:key="L49">Oh, my God<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的天啊</span></p><p begin="02:27.580" end="02:29.413" itunes:key="L50">Ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p begin="02:31.669" end="02:34.351" itunes:key="L51">I love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深爱着你</span></p><p begin="02:37.050" end="02:38.890" itunes:key="L15452">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(噢-噢-噢 噢-喔-噢)</span></p><p begin="02:40.692" end="02:44.474" itunes:key="L15852">I love you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span></p><p begin="02:46.243" end="02:48.472" itunes:key="L52">Ooh, ooh, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竭尽全力 渴望找到我们无法长相厮守的原因</span></p><p begin="02:47.250" end="02:51.583" itunes:key="L53">Tryin' to find a reason why we can't work this out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要找出我们无法修成正果的原因 实在是困难</span></p></div></body></tt>